## Dialog 规范

### 必须使用

- 组件：`src/ai-kit/components/BaseDialog.vue`
- Hook：`src/ai-kit/hooks/useDialog.ts`

### 禁止

- 禁止裸用 `el-dialog`
- 禁止父子双控 visible（useDialog 单一来源）
- 禁止在 Dialog 内部直接调用接口

### 标准用法

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import BaseDialog from '@/ai-kit/components/BaseDialog.vue'
import BaseForm from '@/ai-kit/forms/BaseForm.vue'
import { useDialog } from '@/ai-kit/hooks/useDialog'
import { ref } from 'vue'

const dialog = useDialog<{ id?: number; name: string }>()
const formRef = ref()
const form = ref({ name: '' })

async function handleConfirm() {
  const ok = await formRef.value?.validate()
  if (!ok) return
  dialog.loading.value = true
  try {
    // await saveApi(form.value)
    dialog.confirm()
    fetchList()
  } finally {
    dialog.loading.value = false
  }
}
</script>

<template>
  <BaseDialog
    v-model:visible="dialog.visible.value"
    :title="dialog.payload.value?.id ? '编辑' : '新增'"
    :loading="dialog.loading.value"
    @confirm="handleConfirm"
    @cancel="dialog.close"
  >
    <BaseForm ref="formRef" :model="form" :rules="rules">
      <el-form-item label="名称" prop="name">
        <el-input v-model="form.name" />
      </el-form-item>
    </BaseForm>
  </BaseDialog>
</template>
```

### 要求

- visible 由 useDialog 管理，禁止父子双控
- 关闭自动销毁（BaseDialog 内置 destroy-on-close）
- 确认按钮显示 loading
- ESC / 关闭图标触发 dialog.close()
- 表单校验在 confirm 回调中、接口调用前执行
